{"data":{"featured":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Quizly - Quick Quizes","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/b96a58fd51501420398749b14742e9bc/378b5/Dash2.png","srcSet":"/static/b96a58fd51501420398749b14742e9bc/c05af/Dash2.png 175w,\n/static/b96a58fd51501420398749b14742e9bc/fcecd/Dash2.png 350w,\n/static/b96a58fd51501420398749b14742e9bc/378b5/Dash2.png 700w,\n/static/b96a58fd51501420398749b14742e9bc/88789/Dash2.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/b96a58fd51501420398749b14742e9bc/0bd01/Dash2.avif 175w,\n/static/b96a58fd51501420398749b14742e9bc/9eae4/Dash2.avif 350w,\n/static/b96a58fd51501420398749b14742e9bc/a44ab/Dash2.avif 700w,\n/static/b96a58fd51501420398749b14742e9bc/e18a2/Dash2.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/b96a58fd51501420398749b14742e9bc/ac411/Dash2.webp 175w,\n/static/b96a58fd51501420398749b14742e9bc/60318/Dash2.webp 350w,\n/static/b96a58fd51501420398749b14742e9bc/069ae/Dash2.webp 700w,\n/static/b96a58fd51501420398749b14742e9bc/024b9/Dash2.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":521}}},"tech":["JavaFx","Java","MongoDb","MVC"],"github":"https://github.com/coderbirju/Quizly","external":null},"html":"<p>Quizly is a user-friendly quiz and attendance app that was developed to simplify classroom management. Recognizing that professors often struggled with attendance and gauging student comprehension, we designed Quizly to address these challenges. With Quizly, instructors can effortlessly create quizzes, which students then complete. This not only marks attendance automatically but also provides valuable analytics and insights into class understanding. The technology stack behind Quizly includes JavaFX, Java, and MongoDB, all implemented following the MVC (Model-View-Controller) architecture. This combination ensures a seamless experience for both professors and students, making attendance tracking and concept comprehension assessment hassle-free in the modern classroom environment.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Menace","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/4d353892aaa60ed74d3acdd80255066c/400c3/Menace.png","srcSet":"/static/4d353892aaa60ed74d3acdd80255066c/12aee/Menace.png 175w,\n/static/4d353892aaa60ed74d3acdd80255066c/404ab/Menace.png 350w,\n/static/4d353892aaa60ed74d3acdd80255066c/400c3/Menace.png 700w,\n/static/4d353892aaa60ed74d3acdd80255066c/45ad0/Menace.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/4d353892aaa60ed74d3acdd80255066c/6111d/Menace.avif 175w,\n/static/4d353892aaa60ed74d3acdd80255066c/1107a/Menace.avif 350w,\n/static/4d353892aaa60ed74d3acdd80255066c/e5b8b/Menace.avif 700w,\n/static/4d353892aaa60ed74d3acdd80255066c/d8e4e/Menace.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/4d353892aaa60ed74d3acdd80255066c/887f1/Menace.webp 175w,\n/static/4d353892aaa60ed74d3acdd80255066c/9a6df/Menace.webp 350w,\n/static/4d353892aaa60ed74d3acdd80255066c/9576b/Menace.webp 700w,\n/static/4d353892aaa60ed74d3acdd80255066c/caed5/Menace.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":624.9999999999999}}},"tech":["Python","React","Reinforcement-learning","Flask"],"github":"https://github.com/coderbirju/Menace","external":""},"html":"<p>The <a href=\"https://www.mscroggs.co.uk/blog/19\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">MENACE</a> project seeks to revive \"The Menace,\" a learning machine for mastering Noughts and Crosses (Tic-Tac-Toe). Instead of physical matchboxes, it employs a hash table for efficient game state storage. Originating during a time of limited computing, this modern version utilizes readily available technology. It integrates Reinforcement Learning, rewarding correct moves to enhance decision-making. The machine simulates Noughts and Crosses gameplay, referencing its learned strategies and historical game states stored in the hash table. The primary objective is to create an AI system that independently learns and adapts its gameplay over time, with potential applications extending beyond games to robotics, autonomous systems, and decision-making processes.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"AutoScale API","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/53b0e0aa6300d87bdd39f2680c0cfe9c/683a7/CloudDiagram.png","srcSet":"/static/53b0e0aa6300d87bdd39f2680c0cfe9c/6b7ed/CloudDiagram.png 127w,\n/static/53b0e0aa6300d87bdd39f2680c0cfe9c/68d02/CloudDiagram.png 254w,\n/static/53b0e0aa6300d87bdd39f2680c0cfe9c/683a7/CloudDiagram.png 507w","sizes":"(min-width: 507px) 507px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/53b0e0aa6300d87bdd39f2680c0cfe9c/16342/CloudDiagram.avif 127w,\n/static/53b0e0aa6300d87bdd39f2680c0cfe9c/00488/CloudDiagram.avif 254w,\n/static/53b0e0aa6300d87bdd39f2680c0cfe9c/9f5b0/CloudDiagram.avif 507w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 507px) 507px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/53b0e0aa6300d87bdd39f2680c0cfe9c/20041/CloudDiagram.webp 127w,\n/static/53b0e0aa6300d87bdd39f2680c0cfe9c/3e0f3/CloudDiagram.webp 254w,\n/static/53b0e0aa6300d87bdd39f2680c0cfe9c/e2650/CloudDiagram.webp 507w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 507px) 507px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":597.8303747534517}}},"tech":["Microservices","NestJS","AWS Cloudformation","AWS S3","AWS Lambda","Sendgrid","AWS RDS","AWS Cloudwatch"],"github":"https://github.com/Org-Arjun-Raja-002964082/webapp","external":"https://github.com/orgs/Org-Arjun-Raja-002964082/repositories"},"html":"<p>AutoScale API is a highly scalable microservice designed for a vast customer base, accommodating hundreds of thousands of users. It uses Nest.js for efficient backend code, hosted on AWS EC2 for reliability, with data stored in AWS RDS MySQL for flexibility. File storage is in AWS S3, ensuring security. Email notifications are triggered through AWS Lambda and SES. Error monitoring with AWS CloudWatch and proactive autoscaling based on traffic patterns optimize resource allocation for user demand fluctuations, ensuring a seamless experience for our users.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"CampChamp - Find your campground","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/059dbefbe1ea7855ab38ef1dad16da5d/5cbfa/campChamp.png","srcSet":"/static/059dbefbe1ea7855ab38ef1dad16da5d/4a714/campChamp.png 175w,\n/static/059dbefbe1ea7855ab38ef1dad16da5d/aeb3b/campChamp.png 350w,\n/static/059dbefbe1ea7855ab38ef1dad16da5d/5cbfa/campChamp.png 700w,\n/static/059dbefbe1ea7855ab38ef1dad16da5d/c46be/campChamp.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/059dbefbe1ea7855ab38ef1dad16da5d/218dd/campChamp.avif 175w,\n/static/059dbefbe1ea7855ab38ef1dad16da5d/7fbd3/campChamp.avif 350w,\n/static/059dbefbe1ea7855ab38ef1dad16da5d/84a37/campChamp.avif 700w,\n/static/059dbefbe1ea7855ab38ef1dad16da5d/15b7c/campChamp.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/059dbefbe1ea7855ab38ef1dad16da5d/d5efe/campChamp.webp 175w,\n/static/059dbefbe1ea7855ab38ef1dad16da5d/b74fb/campChamp.webp 350w,\n/static/059dbefbe1ea7855ab38ef1dad16da5d/8b234/campChamp.webp 700w,\n/static/059dbefbe1ea7855ab38ef1dad16da5d/a82ec/campChamp.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":384}}},"tech":["Bootstrap","Express","HTML5","CSS3","MongoDB","Heroku"],"github":"https://github.com/coderbirju/CampChamp","external":"https://powerful-mesa-36430.herokuapp.com"},"html":"<p>CampChamp is a website for adventurers who like to go camping. It's a platform form campers to share pictures and experience from their previous trips.</p>\n<p>The project was my segue into web development and becoming a full stack software engineer. The website is minimalitic in design and uses pure HTML5 and CSS3 for styling. The project is deployed on the Heroku platform and github CI/CD.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Smart contract : Dutch Auction","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/b8bf1e7d9ff9d955813fa9d01e71026a/683c1/solidity.webp","srcSet":"/static/b8bf1e7d9ff9d955813fa9d01e71026a/9e66f/solidity.webp 175w,\n/static/b8bf1e7d9ff9d955813fa9d01e71026a/c2d19/solidity.webp 350w,\n/static/b8bf1e7d9ff9d955813fa9d01e71026a/683c1/solidity.webp 700w,\n/static/b8bf1e7d9ff9d955813fa9d01e71026a/34004/solidity.webp 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/b8bf1e7d9ff9d955813fa9d01e71026a/7624c/solidity.avif 175w,\n/static/b8bf1e7d9ff9d955813fa9d01e71026a/1f9cf/solidity.avif 350w,\n/static/b8bf1e7d9ff9d955813fa9d01e71026a/6ecf4/solidity.avif 700w,\n/static/b8bf1e7d9ff9d955813fa9d01e71026a/e0956/solidity.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":453.00000000000006}}},"tech":["Solidity","Hardhat","React","MetaMask","Ethereum"],"github":"https://github.com/coderbirju/DutchAuctionForge","external":"https://github.com/coderbirju/v6.0"},"html":"<p>Dutch Auction is a blockchain-powered system running on the Ethereum network, designed to streamline Dutch auctions for the sale of physical and digital assets. Leveraging Ethereum's renowned smart contract capabilities and decentralization, the project utilizes Solidity as its contract language to establish auction rules and facilitate asset transfers securely. With the development environment powered by Hardhat, the platform ensures efficient smart contract development and testing. The user-friendly frontend, built on React, enhances interactivity, while MetaMask integration ensures secure participation. Operating on the Ethereum network offers global accessibility and robust security, making it an ideal choice for conducting Dutch auctions for a wide range of assets.</p>"}}]}}}